    "The camera is turned off for MimoDays": {
      "comment": "C13a title: camera access was denied in Settings",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera is turned off for MimoDays"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera turns on only while this screen is open, and only you start a recording. Nothing is captured in the background or sent anywhere.": {
      "comment": "C06 body: camera explainer",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera turns on only while this screen is open, and only you start a recording. Nothing is captured in the background or sent anywhere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone records only while you are recording a video or a voice note. You can say no: videos are still saved, just silent.": {
      "comment": "C06c body: microphone explainer",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone records only while you are recording a video or a voice note. You can say no: videos are still saved, just silent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To capture moments, allow camera access in Settings. You can still write notes and record voice notes from Today.": {
      "comment": "C13a body: camera access off",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To capture moments, allow camera access in Settings. You can still write notes and record voice notes from Today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
